        "                                                                                ",
        "    Back                                                                        ",
        "                                                                                ",
        "  Where Practice sends its requests. OpenRouter is the only provider so far.    ",
        "  In config.toml: provider = "openrouter"                                       ",
        "  ? keys  : actions  q back                                                     ",
